 <h2 class="nfp-h2 nfp-s6h">Frequently asked questions</h2>
 <div class="nfp-fq">
 <details open><summary class="nfp-q1">How do I use the laundry perfume?</summary><div class="nfp-fqp nfp-w1">Add the laundry perfume straight into the fabric-softener compartment of your washing machine. The recommended dose is <strong>5 ml per 4&ndash;5 kg load</strong>. It works with any detergent, but do not combine it with fabric softener &mdash; that would dilute the fragrance.</div></details>
 <details><summary class="nfp-q2">How long does the scent last on clothes?</summary><div class="nfp-fqp nfp-w2">Our laundry perfumes are formulated to last <strong>up to 14 days</strong>, depending on the fabric, the drying method and the amount used. Base notes such as amber, sandalwood and cedar help the scent hold over time.</div></details>
 <details><summary class="nfp-q3">Is it safe for sensitive skin or children&rsquo;s clothes?</summary><div class="nfp-fqp nfp-w3">Yes. All our formulas are dermatologically tested and free from parabens, dyes and major allergens. They are suitable for baby clothes, bed linen and textiles in direct contact with sensitive skin.</div></details>
 <details><summary class="nfp-q4">Is the laundry perfume vegan and cruelty-free?</summary><div class="nfp-fqp nfp-w4">Yes. All our laundry perfumes are <strong>100% vegan and never tested on animals</strong>. We use no animal-derived ingredients, and our manufacturing follows ethical and sustainable standards.</div></details>
 </div>
